      "id": "claim_38330c3976c14cbeb51a85f8ccebd5fe",
      "statement": "POST /api/tasks returns immediately after inserting a 'pending' task row and uses Next.js after() to schedule three background callbacks (branch-name generation, title generation, and processTaskWithTimeout) so the serverless function is not killed when the response is flushed.",
