      "id": "claim_36a732210ddd4a4fac3f2a390c5b2b16",
      "statement": "createSandbox runs a fixed pipeline - validate env vars, build authenticated repo URL, Sandbox.create, git clone (depth 1) to /vercel/sandbox/project, optional dependency install (Node or Python) with npm/pnpm/yarn detection, optional detached dev-server start with Vite/Next.js port selection, optional agent-browser install with a per-agent skill file, git config, and branch resolution - and returns SandboxResult { success, sandbox, domain, branchName } or { success: false, cancelled: true } to distinguish a stop from a failure.",
