      "id": "claim_72027b9c3ccf4e43906f4024f182f628",
      "statement": "executeAgentInSandbox implements a temp-env-var pattern: it snapshots OPENAI_API_KEY, GEMINI_API_KEY, CURSOR_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY, GH_TOKEN, and GITHUB_TOKEN from process.env into originalEnv, overrides them with the user-supplied apiKeys (and the Copilot GitHub token when applicable), and restores the originals in a finally block so per-user credentials never leak across tasks on the shared worker process.",
