      "id": "claim_150af1632ce64d85975832121de8304a",
      "statement": "On successful agent execution the worker persists agentSessionId (for follow-up --resume), saves the agent response to taskMessages, generates a commit message via the AI Gateway (with createFallbackCommitMessage as fallback), runs pushChangesToBranch, and only then either transitions tasks.status to 'completed' (with progress=100) or to 'error' when pushFailed is true; sandbox shutdown is gated by keepAlive - keepAlive=true leaves the sandbox for follow-ups, keepAlive=false calls unregisterSandbox plus shutdownSandbox.",
